# RTK receiver as the truth for scoring outdoor flights (docs/partner-pack.md, "Truth for
# scoring outdoors"; docs/rtk-truth.md).
# Confidential. Copyright (c) 2026 Zain Ali. All rights reserved.
# QGroundControl plain-text format. Load AFTER structure_hold_flight.params, then reboot.
#
# The receiver must be in the log and out of the estimate. Its own set-up (serial port,
# GPS_1_CONFIG, corrections) stays what your drone already has.
#
# SDLOG_PROFILE 2195 = structure_hold_flight.params' 147 + high-rate sensors (bit 11, 2048):
#   sensor_gps at the receiver's full rate. Without the bit PX4 v1.17 logs sensor_gps once a
#   second, which the scorer refuses as a truth.
# EKF2_GPS_CTRL 0: EKF2 fuses nothing from the receiver. Fused, the truth would be the
#   estimate's own source; the scorer checks EKF2's aiding flags and says so on the report.
# SYS_HAS_GPS 0: no GPS preflight requirement (the drone flies on its VIO).
1	1	SDLOG_PROFILE	2195	6
1	1	EKF2_GPS_CTRL	0	6
1	1	SYS_HAS_GPS	0	6
